	quests: [
		{
			dependencies: ["24174700F7FB771C"]
			description: ["We're beginning with the &cFission Reactor&r—our first Mekanism Reactor. It's a &9multiblock&r structure that burns &aFissile Fuel&r to generate heat, which is then used to produce power via an Industrial &bTurbine&r by heating &1coolent&r. While powerful, it's also dangerous: meltdowns can cause explosions and &aradiation&r spreading across a 5-chunk radius for in-game weeks. To stay safe, we’ll start by crafting a &6Hazmat Suit&r."]
			id: "36B1995B495AA674"
